    "detailed_description": "<strong>Soulrise</strong> is a game about high-risk jumps, inspired by Jump King and other precision platformer. <br><br>Trapped beneath a forgotten tower, lost souls await your help. They must ascend to the top of this Structure, overcome challenging obstacles and uncover hidden secrets - you're their only chance of salvation. Every jump must be carefully considered, as there's a lot at stake... One mistake and your progress is set back by an unpleasant fall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/fb0e5e32bff09261675ee8fe00351dc1.webp?t=1733242317\" width=616 height=39 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/93ab3a84f0bb1290c0f2f6677a0bbc1b.poster.avif?t=1733242317\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/93ab3a84f0bb1290c0f2f6677a0bbc1b.webm?t=1733242317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/93ab3a84f0bb1290c0f2f6677a0bbc1b.mp4?t=1733242317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience Soulrise alone or with up to three friends<br></li><li> Rotate your sword 360\u00b0 around your player to determine the direction of each jump<br></li><li> Hold and release at the right moment to give your jumps the necessary power<br></li><li> Explore a tower with 10 different sections and hidden secrets<br></li><li> Try to avoid mistakes... Every fall has serious consequences.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/6aa651cff72d72ce0f72658aa1d65e25.webp?t=1733242317\" width=616 height=39 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/d9757b164ed932a68cb833418c779eb9.poster.avif?t=1733242317\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/d9757b164ed932a68cb833418c779eb9.webm?t=1733242317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/d9757b164ed932a68cb833418c779eb9.mp4?t=1733242317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience Soulrise alone or with up to three friends. Explore the abandoned tower together to find the best path to the top. <br>Or compete against each other in a specially designed mode.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Adventure Mode: 1-4 players</strong> - Explore the tower together and exchange ideas to overcome difficult obstacles. Together you'll find the best way to the top!<br><br></li><li> <strong>Versus Mode: 1-4 players</strong> - Set a time limit and race against each other. Alternatively, set a goal and find out who can reach it the fastest!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Soulrise</strong> is a game about high-risk jumps, inspired by Jump King and other precision platformer. <br><br>Trapped beneath a forgotten tower, lost souls await your help. They must ascend to the top of this Structure, overcome challenging obstacles and uncover hidden secrets - you're their only chance of salvation. Every jump must be carefully considered, as there's a lot at stake... One mistake and your progress is set back by an unpleasant fall.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/fb0e5e32bff09261675ee8fe00351dc1.webp?t=1733242317\" width=616 height=39 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/93ab3a84f0bb1290c0f2f6677a0bbc1b.poster.avif?t=1733242317\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/93ab3a84f0bb1290c0f2f6677a0bbc1b.webm?t=1733242317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/93ab3a84f0bb1290c0f2f6677a0bbc1b.mp4?t=1733242317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience Soulrise alone or with up to three friends<br></li><li> Rotate your sword 360\u00b0 around your player to determine the direction of each jump<br></li><li> Hold and release at the right moment to give your jumps the necessary power<br></li><li> Explore a tower with 10 different sections and hidden secrets<br></li><li> Try to avoid mistakes... Every fall has serious consequences.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/6aa651cff72d72ce0f72658aa1d65e25.webp?t=1733242317\" width=616 height=39 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/d9757b164ed932a68cb833418c779eb9.poster.avif?t=1733242317\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/d9757b164ed932a68cb833418c779eb9.webm?t=1733242317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887590/extras/d9757b164ed932a68cb833418c779eb9.mp4?t=1733242317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experience Soulrise alone or with up to three friends. Explore the abandoned tower together to find the best path to the top. <br>Or compete against each other in a specially designed mode.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Adventure Mode: 1-4 players</strong> - Explore the tower together and exchange ideas to overcome difficult obstacles. Together you'll find the best way to the top!<br><br></li><li> <strong>Versus Mode: 1-4 players</strong> - Set a time limit and race against each other. Alternatively, set a goal and find out who can reach it the fastest!</li></ul>",
